    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lava in Maze - Mazes for watch",
      "description": "Looking for a quick but intense challenge on your wrist? Take control of a glowing lava bubble and navigate through infinite, randomly generated mazes designed for your Apple Watch.\n\nNo two games are ever the same. Will you find the exit before time runs out?\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n• Live Maze Construction: Watch the labyrinth build itself in real-time right before your eyes. Every round is a fresh, unique puzzle!\n• Dynamic Difficulties: Start easy, but be prepared. As you level up, mazes grow larger, twisting into complex brain-teasers.\n• Strategic 'Zoom Out': Feeling stuck? Pause the game to unlock a full bird’s-eye view of the maze. Plan your optimal route to the exit, but use it wisely!\n• 100% Watch Optimized: Smooth performance and a UI tailored specifically for your Apple Watch screen.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n• Intuitive Controls: Simply tap the directional arrows on your screen to flow your lava bubble through the corridors. Easy to pick up, impossible to put down.\n\nChallenge your mind, test your reflexes, and escape the lava maze today!",
